# Project Title: THE COFFEE MACHINE

## Description

This folder has a main script that is used so for a coffee machine. The purpose of the coffee machine is to request a choice from the user based off of its selections, process coins by the user as well as change accurately.


### Dependencies

Optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for the Coffee Machine. Not mandatory, but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

Mandatory: 

KEY POINTS:
1. The coffee machine has 3 hot flavours
2. The machine is coin operated and must be able to process coins and change appropriately.
3. Machine must be able to print a report and check if resources are sufficient

### Installations Needed

NA

